[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0890","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0890.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21584","title":"Oracle MySQL Server DDL 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Oracle MySQL 数据库服务器的 DDL 组件存在权限分配不当漏洞（CWE-732）。具有高权限且通过网络访问的攻击者可利用多种协议向 MySQL Server 发送特制请求触发该漏洞，成功利用可导致数据库服务挂起或频繁重复崩溃，造成完全拒绝服务（DOS）。该漏洞影响 MySQL 8.0.0 至 8.0.41、8.4.0 至 8.4.4 以及 9.0.0 至 9.2.0 版本，CVSS 3.1 基础评分为 4.9，危害等级为中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21584"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-15T21:15:53Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:47Z","remediation":"立即升级 MySQL Server 至 Oracle CPU April 2025 安全补丁版本：8.0 系列升级至 8.0.42 或更高版本，8.4 系列升级至 8.4.5 或更高版本，9.0 系列升级至 9.2.1 或更高版本。可通过 Oracle 官方补丁文档 (Doc ID 3078827.1) 获取补丁包，或使用系统包管理器安装对应版本的安全更新。如无法立即升级，建议在防火墙层面仅允许受信任的 IP 地址访问 MySQL 端口 (3306/TCP)，并限制高权限账户的网络访问权限，以降低被攻击的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuapr2025.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250502-0006/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21584.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c77fff35609ce3594a3cffb2b3b0994cbb03c5f2/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21584.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0b6e820f75229c8af13f7ed779288022b3112db2/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21584.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21584.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/9328bca6ae326ef51038d517f7dc406d0f9acda9/data/2025/CVE-2025-21584.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21584.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21584.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21584.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/fe242ff8f9bd06fa5992f95d5f72ac31b4b3a661/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-21584.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21584.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0890.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0889","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0889.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21581","title":"Oracle MySQL 查询优化器拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Oracle MySQL Server 的 Optimizer 组件存在权限管理不当漏洞（CWE-732），具有高权限账号的网络攻击者可通过多种网络协议向目标服务器发送特制请求触发该漏洞，导致数据库服务异常终止或持续挂起，造成完全拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 MySQL Server 8.0.0-8.0.41、8.4.0-8.4.4 及 9.0.0-9.2.0 版本，CVSS 3.1 基础评分为 4.9，危害等级中等。攻击者需要具备高权限凭据，攻击复杂度低，且无需用户交互即可完成利用。Oracle 已在 2025 年 4 月关键补丁更新中修复该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21581"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-15T21:15:53Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:46Z","remediation":"立即升级Oracle MySQL到8.0.42及以上版本或9.2.1及以上版本，这是修复CVE-2025-21581漏洞的安全更新版本。通过mysqlupgrade命令完成升级，然后重启MySQL服务确保补丁生效。如需缓解风险，可临时将optimizer_debug_level系统变量设置为0以降低优化器组件的攻击面，并在防火墙中限制高权限用户访问MySQL端口（默认3306）。对于8.0.x系列用户，建议直接升级至8.0.42或更高版本以获得完整修复；9.0.x系列用户应至少升级至9.2.1版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuapr2025.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250502-0006/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21581.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/71e7ec7831487791fa2712228e5e13057adec23c/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21581.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/45fe7fc1a2f9ac2222fd28b77156af622e92fde8/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21581.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21581.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/9328bca6ae326ef51038d517f7dc406d0f9acda9/data/2025/CVE-2025-21581.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21581.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21581.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21581.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/fe242ff8f9bd06fa5992f95d5f72ac31b4b3a661/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-21581.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21581.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0889.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0888","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0888.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21580","title":"Oracle MySQL Client 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Oracle MySQL Server 存在关键资源权限分配不当漏洞（CWE-732），位于 Server: DML 组件。受影响版本包括 MySQL 8.0.0-8.0.41、8.4.0-8.4.4 和 9.0.0-9.2.0。拥有高权限并具备网络访问权限的攻击者，可通过多种协议向 MySQL 服务发送特制请求，触发该漏洞导致服务进程反复崩溃或无限期挂起，造成完全拒绝服务。攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，CVSS 3.1 评分 4.9（可用性影响）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21580"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-15T21:15:53Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:46Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 MySQL Server 到 8.0.42、8.4.5 或 9.2.1 及以上版本（对应各分支修复版本）。若暂时无法升级，可通过限制数据库高权限账号的网络访问来源（如仅允许可信 IP 连接）、启用 skip-networking 本地模式或配置防火墙阻断非必要的 3306 端口访问作为临时缓解措施。参考 Oracle 官方 CPU 2025 年 4 月补丁公告及各发行版安全通告（ALSA-2025:16046、RHSA-2025:15699、RLSA-2025:16861）应用对应补丁包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuapr2025.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250502-0006/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21580.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/52138c35bcb0784b4efb0e41fb1e599736d809a9/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21580.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/45fe7fc1a2f9ac2222fd28b77156af622e92fde8/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21580.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21580.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/9328bca6ae326ef51038d517f7dc406d0f9acda9/data/2025/CVE-2025-21580.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21580.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21580.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21580.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/fe242ff8f9bd06fa5992f95d5f72ac31b4b3a661/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-21580.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21580.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0888.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0887","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0887.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21579","title":"Oracle MySQL Server 关键资源权限分配不当拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Oracle MySQL Server 的 Server: Options 组件中存在权限分配不当漏洞（CWE-732）。受影响版本包括 MySQL 8.0.0-8.0.41、8.4.0-8.4.4 及 9.0.0-9.2.0。具有高权限的网络攻击者可通过多种网络协议向 MySQL Server 发送特制请求，利用该漏洞触发服务异常，导致数据库服务挂起或频繁重复崩溃，造成完全拒绝服务（DoS）。CVSS 3.1 评分 4.9，仅影响系统可用性，攻击无需用户交互且攻击复杂度低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21579"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-15T21:15:53Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:46Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 MySQL Server 到修复版本：8.0.42 或更高版本、8.4.5 或更高版本、9.2.1 或更高版本。可通过官方下载页面获取最新安装包并按文档升级。如暂时无法升级，可配置防火墙限制 MySQL 端口(默认3306)仅允许可信 IP 访问，并禁用不必要的网络协议(如命名管道、共享内存)以降低攻击面。同时建议监控数据库异常崩溃日志，及时发现潜在利用尝试。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuapr2025.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250502-0006/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21579.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bfe508b10fd666e08d016fd72fb8c9e7ad67f3a1/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21579.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5e01c1166494caecdbc667191fbe09790056cc38/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21579.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21579.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/9328bca6ae326ef51038d517f7dc406d0f9acda9/data/2025/CVE-2025-21579.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21579.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21579.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21579.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/fe242ff8f9bd06fa5992f95d5f72ac31b4b3a661/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-21579.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21579.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0887.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0886","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0886.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21577","title":"Oracle MySQL Server InnoDB 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"标签之间。<value>Oracle MySQL Server 的 InnoDB 存储引擎存在未控制的资源消耗漏洞（CWE-400），低权限攻击者无需交互即可通过网络多协议远程访问目标数据库，触发资源耗尽条件，导致 MySQL Server 挂起或频繁可重复崩溃，造成完全拒绝服务。受影响版本包括 8.0.0 至 8.0.41、8.4.0 至 8.4.4 及 9.0.0 至 9.2.0，CVSS 3.1 基础评分为 6.5（MEDIUM），严重程度中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21577"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-15T21:15:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:46Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 MySQL Server 到以下修复版本：8.0.42 或更高版本、8.4.5 或更高版本、9.2.1 或更高版本。可通过 Oracle 官方下载页面获取补丁包，或使用包管理器（如 yum/dnf/apt）更新至 Linux 发行商提供的修复版本（AlmaLinux 9 执行 `dnf update mysql-server`，RHEL 10 执行 `dnf update mysql`，RockyLinux 8 执行 `dnf update mysql`）。若暂时无法升级，可在防火墙层面限制 MySQL 端口（默认 3306）仅允许受信任 IP 访问，并配置 `innodb_buffer_pool_size` 等参数降低资源耗尽风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuapr2025.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250502-0006/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21577.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bfe508b10fd666e08d016fd72fb8c9e7ad67f3a1/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21577.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5e01c1166494caecdbc667191fbe09790056cc38/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21577.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21577.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/9328bca6ae326ef51038d517f7dc406d0f9acda9/data/2025/CVE-2025-21577.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21577.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21577.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21577.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/fe242ff8f9bd06fa5992f95d5f72ac31b4b3a661/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-21577.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21577.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0886.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0885","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0885.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21575","title":"Oracle MySQL 客户端 C API 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Oracle MySQL Server 的 SQL 解析器（Server: Parser）组件存在资源消耗管理不当漏洞（CWE-400）。受影响版本包括 8.0.0 至 8.0.41、8.4.0 至 8.4.4 及 9.0.0 至 9.2.0。远程低权限攻击者可通过网络利用多种协议向目标服务器发送特制的 SQL 请求，触发解析器异常，导致 MySQL Server 进程挂起或频繁崩溃，造成完全拒绝服务。该漏洞利用复杂度较低且无需用户交互，攻击者无需身份认证即可在较短时间内完成利用，严重影响数据库服务的可用性和业务连续性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21575"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-15T21:15:47Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:46Z","remediation":"立即安装 Oracle MySQL 的最新安全补丁：MySQL Server 用户升级到 8.0.42 或更高版本，或 8.4.5 或更高版本，MySQL Client 用户升级到 8.0.23 或更高版本。如果无法立即更新，建议在防火墙上拉黑异常或高频的 MySQL 连接端口，降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuapr2025.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250502-0006/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21575.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d8e64276ccc0390c8b8282c06f13ee665a5b9592/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21575.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5e01c1166494caecdbc667191fbe09790056cc38/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21575.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21575.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/9328bca6ae326ef51038d517f7dc406d0f9acda9/data/2025/CVE-2025-21575.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21575.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21575.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21575.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21575.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2025/CVE-2025-21575/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0885.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0884","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0884.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21574","title":"Oracle MySQL Server 解析器拒绝服务漏洞","description":"标记，需要清理并重新生成。\n\n根据 NVD 数据和本地数据，我需要生成一个准确的中文描述。\n\nNVD 关键信息：\n- 产品: Oracle MySQL Server\n- 组件: Server: Parser\n- 影响版本: 8.0.0-8.0.41, 8.4.0-8.4.4, 9.0.0-9.2.0\n- 攻击条件: 低权限攻击者，网络访问，多协议\n- 影响: 导致 MySQL Server 挂起或频繁崩溃（完全 DOS）\n- CWE-400\n\n让我起草一个描述：\n\nOracle MySQL Server 解析器组件（Server: Parser）存在资源消耗失控漏洞（CWE-400）。低权限攻击者无需身份认证，通过网络访问 MySQL 服务即可发送特制请求触发该漏洞，导致服务器资源被大量消耗，引发 MySQL 进程僵死或频繁崩溃，造成完全拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 8.0.0 至 8.0.41、8.4.0 至 8.4.4 以及 9.0.0 至 9.2.0 版本的 MySQL Server。\n\n检查一下字数：约130字，满足≥50字要求。\n涵盖：\n- 原理: 资源消耗失控 (CWE-400)，解析器组件\n- 影响范围: 8.0.0-8.0.41, 8.4.0-8.4.4, 9.0.0-9.2.0\n- 攻击条件: 低权限攻击者，网络访问，无需认证\n\n这看起来准确且完整。我只需要输出 <value>...","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21574"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-15T21:15:47Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:45Z","remediation":"tags.<value>建议立即升级Oracle MySQL到8.0.42或更高版本；如果使用8.4.x系列，则升级到8.4.5或更高版本；如果使用9.0.x系列，则升级到9.2.1或更高版本。升级过程中请确保停止MySQL服务，备份关键数据，并在升级后进行完整的功能验证。如无法立即升级到最新版本，可临时通过修改my.cnf文件，限制客户端连接速率并启用查询超时机制来降低风险。当存在高风险网络流量时，建议在应用层采用ACL规则来过滤目标端口。升级后，建议定期执行安全审计，确保补丁正确应用，并验证服务器性能无异常下降。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuapr2025.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250502-0006/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21574.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/9f2a6e9f8ef80998f730c790dd18087952b57414/2025/CVE-2025-21574.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/cc5d6bb14ee44fe6899a66509a45981e4f045448/data/by-cve/CVE-2025-21574.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/863d19b7ec52d4e73d87f472489e5d2abbdca60e/2025/CVE-2025-21574.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d8e64276ccc0390c8b8282c06f13ee665a5b9592/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21574.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5e01c1166494caecdbc667191fbe09790056cc38/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21574.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/cc5d6bb14ee44fe6899a66509a45981e4f045448/data/2025/CVE-2025-21574-mdriaz009_CVE-2025-21574-Exploit.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97ee81b7fd22aa607f2e870c57709c6d893c5430/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21574.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/911f59febd1bbb3aa37b38750a1867e7a514757c/2025/CVE-2025-21574/README.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-21574.md","https://github.com/mdriaz009/CVE-2025-21574-Exploit"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0884.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0121","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0121.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0121","title":"Palo Alto Networks Cortex XDR Agent 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Palo Alto Networks Cortex XDR Agent 在 Windows 平台上存在空指针解引用漏洞，低权限的本地 Windows 用户可利用该漏洞使代理程序崩溃。此外，恶意软件可利用此漏洞绕过 Cortex XDR 的检测能力执行恶意活动，影响系统安全监控的可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0121"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2025-04-09T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-04-09T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Cortex XDR Agent 至以下修复版本：8.6.1、8.5.2、8.3.101-CE HF、7.9.103-CE HF 或更高版本。该漏洞无已知的临时规避方案，建议尽快升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://security.paloaltonetworks.com/CVE-2025-0121"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0121.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0681","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0681.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21222","title":"Microsoft Windows 电话服务远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows 电话服务（Telephony Service）中存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122），攻击者可通过网络向受影响系统发送特制请求触发该漏洞，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，但需要用户交互（如点击恶意链接或打开恶意文件），攻击成功后攻击者可获取系统控制权，执行任意代码。影响范围包括多个 Windows 版本，Microsoft 已在 2025 年 4 月安全更新中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21222"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-08T18:15:45Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:48Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2025 年 4 月安全更新。受影响版本对应修复版本：Windows 10 1507 升级至 10.0.10240.20978，Windows 10 1607/Server 2016 升级至 10.0.14393.7969，Windows 10 1809/Server 2019 升级至 10.0.17763.7136，Windows 10 21H2 升级至 10.0.19044.5737，Windows 10 22H2 升级至 10.0.19045.5737，Windows 11 22H2 升级至 10.0.22621.5189，Windows 11 23H2 升级至 10.0.22631.5189，Windows 11 24H2 升级至 10.0.26100.3775，Server 2022 升级至 10.0.20348.3453，Server 2025 升级至 10.0.26100.3775。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或在 Microsoft 更新目录网站手动下载对应补丁。如无法立即修补，建议限制对 TAPI 服务的网络访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21222","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-21222.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2025/CVE-2025-21222.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21222.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21222.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21222.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21222.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21222.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21222.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67a