969，Windows 10 1809/Server 2019 升级到 10.0.17763.7136，Windows 10 21H2 升级到 10.0.19044.5737，Windows 10 22H2 升级到 10.0.19045.5737，Windows 11 22H2 升级到 10.0.22621.5189，Windows 11 23H2 升级到 10.0.22631.5189，Windows 11 24H2 升级到 10.0.26100.3775，Server 2022 升级到 10.0.20348.3453。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft 更新目录网站手动下载安装。临时缓解措施：限制本地用户对 LSA 子系统的交互式登录权限，并启用 Windows Defender Credential Guard 以降低 LSA 进程被利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21191","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21191.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21191.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21191.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21191.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21191.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21191.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b258f1790af19a85ccc98f5e771360cd7a4cb4d7/2025/CVE-2025-21191.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21191","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21191.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21191"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0653.toml"}]